    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Given the user has &quot;Clara Stripe Knit Sweater&quot; in the cart | And the user is on the cart page | When the user applies coupon code &quot;DISKON99&quot; | Then a coupon error notice should be displayed indicating the coupon does not exist</Data></Cell>
